@startuml diagrama_sequencia_pncp_g07
title Diagrama de Sequência — Integração com API PNCP

skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 1
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderThickness 0.5
skinparam sequenceLifeLineBorderColor #888

participant "Scheduler" as SCH #F1EFE8
participant "ServicoConsulta" as SVC #E6F1FB
participant "ClientePNCP" as CLI #E6F1FB
participant "API PNCP" as API #E1F5EE
participant "RepositorioStatus" as REP #EEEDFE
participant "ServicoNotif." as NOT #FAEEDA

SCH  ->  SVC : 1. tick()
SVC  ->  CLI : 2. consultarPregao(id)
CLI  ->  API : 3. GET /pregoes/{id}
API  --> CLI : 4. StatusDTO

SVC  ->  REP : 5. buscarUltimoStatus(id)
REP  --> SVC : 6. StatusPregao atual

alt [mudou]
  SVC  ->  REP : 7. salvarNovoStatus()
  REP  --> SVC : 8. ok
end

SVC  ->  NOT : 9. notificarMudanca(status)
NOT  --> SVC : 10. e-mail + in-app enviados

SVC  ->  REP : 11. registrarConsulta(log)
REP  --> SVC : 12. auditoria registrada

@enduml
